\"bb_paragraph\" >While investigating his bean field, he makes a crucial discovery: these creatures are vulnerable to them! Wasting no time, John rushes back home for his hat, because now he\u2019ll need your help to grab his revolver and some explosives. Together, you\u2019ll face the reptilians and uncover the hidden truth behind this invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you may have noticed, you won't be alone on this adventure: you'll have explosives, an item to improve your aim, and three peculiar weapons that will add variety to your arsenal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576410/extras/32f819ffa12a90f3f4d36f1f7cceb2cb.avif?t=1771364609\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Need even more power? John's fists are also ready to go into action when things get tough.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576410/extras/0a5286d9c759d6e54c667f87058d1fee.avif?t=1771364609\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Worried about your safety? Don't fear, you can also use an old metal funnel that, against all odds, works as an improvised shield. Fashion and protection have never been so united!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576410/extras/4844ae2ed76960e6b385218a8867bea7.avif?t=1771364609\" width=600 height=100 /></span>And remember: if your hat gets knocked off, you'd better be quick to put it back on... or you'll be doomed.<br><br><i><u>The game will implement achievements.</u></i><i><u>No graphics in this game were created with AI.</u></i><i><u></u></i></p>","developers":["PabloDev"],"dlc":[4267980],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co